    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Strength or Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Headlock.</strong> Your allies have Advantage on attack rolls against a creature Grappled by you.</p><p><strong>Sturdy Knot.</strong> When you bind a creature with Chain, Manacles, or Rope, add your Proficiency Bonus to the DC to escape or burst it.</p><p><strong>Tough Talk.</strong> A creature's Hostile attitude doesn't impose Disadvantage on your Charisma (Intimidation) checks to influence it.</p>",
